n folders, a printed checklist sheet with tick boxes, and a laptop showing the package's Excel tools (a two-column comparison table, a working-time calculator with rows per staff type, a recap of staff need per unit with a bar chart comparing current staff with calculated need; no readable text). Do not redesign, simplify, recolor, or rebrand the box. SET & PROPS: Hospital HR archive room in the morning: tall metal shelves with rows of colored binders (no readable labels), a small work desk by the window with a laptop and an open old binder, soft daylight through the window, dust-free and orderly. No other people visible. TIMELINE — 10 seconds: 0–2s Hook · close-up: an open old binder page with blurred lines (no readable text); cut to medium shot between shelves as she looks up to the camera. VO (ID, verbatim): "SK perencanaan kami masih aturan lama." Delivery (EN): surprised, honest 2–4s Problem · medium shot, she flips to another page in the binder. VO (ID, verbatim): "Padahal aturan itu sudah dicabut." Delivery (EN): concerned 4–6s Problem · medium close-up, she glances along the shelf of binders. VO (ID, verbatim): "Pedomannya juga ikut yang lama." Delivery (EN): worried 6–8s Problem · medium shot, she closes the binder and looks at the camera. VO (ID, verbatim): "Saya cek sebelum ada yang tanya." Delivery (EN): quiet, determined 8–10s Beat · medium shot, she carries the binder to the desk by the window. VO: none. AUDIO: Quiet archive room, soft page turning, faint footsteps far away. Only the talent speaks. Natural Indonesian, conversational, clear pronunciation, no background music. Lighting/mood: realistic natural light matching the set, clean soft contrast, believable Indonesian setting, not glossy, not studio. Camera: follow the camera style above consistently; stable and restrained, no whip pans, no drone, no 360 orbit. Keep product readable whenever it is on screen. Performance: natural facial expression, believable professional UGC, natural eye contact, 